format 1
adapter chat 1
npc: npc-ray

node chat-ray-up-airport
kind: unprompted
pose: explain
trigger: lessons_completed:13
title: Airport. Bag. X-ray.

    I'm in the airport security line.

    My bag is on the belt. It's going into the X-ray machine. Machine's making X-rays. Bag's getting scanned.

    Someone behind me just asked if the bag will come out radioactive.

reply: will it? -> chat-ray-airport-will
reply: that person is wrong, right? -> chat-ray-airport-wrong

node chat-ray-airport-will
kind: reply
pose: think

    Think it through. You know this one.

    An X-ray is radiation. Radiation is energy. It doesn't spread. Radioactive material does, if it's there.

    Is there radioactive material in my bag?

reply: no, so nothing to spread -> chat-ray-airport-right
reply: yes, the X-rays leave some -> chat-ray-airport-miss

node chat-ray-airport-wrong
kind: reply
pose: proud

    I told them what I'd tell you. Don't mix up two different things.

    Exposed: in the path of radiation. Contaminated: radioactive material on you or in you.

    My bag's exposed. It isn't contaminated. Different things.

reply: oh, I get it -> chat-ray-airport-end
reply: so what would contamination be? -> chat-ray-airport-contam

node chat-ray-airport-right
kind: reply
pose: proud

    Right. No material, nothing to spread.

    Exposure and contamination aren't the same. The bag is exposed to the X-rays for a moment. It isn't carrying anything.

sticker: nerd -> chat-ray-airport-end
sticker: star -> chat-ray-airport-end

node chat-ray-airport-miss
kind: reply
pose: explain

    Not quite. Radiation doesn't spread. Only the material does.

    Radiation from a source can reach you. That's exposure. It isn't contamination.

reply: ok, that makes sense -> chat-ray-airport-end
reply: so what would contamination be? -> chat-ray-airport-contam

node chat-ray-airport-contam
kind: reply
pose: point

    Radioactive material on the bag. Dust on it. Or inside it.

    Nothing like that here. Just a machine making X-rays and a bag passing through.

sticker: nerd -> chat-ray-airport-end
sticker: star -> chat-ray-airport-end

node chat-ray-airport-end
kind: sign_off
pose: greet

    Bag's through. Collecting it.

    Short version: exposed isn't contaminated. Remember it.
